Reason: sets CONFIG_H264_DECODER and CONFIG_AAC_DECODER to 0 in the
Chrome-branded macOS arm64 configuration, as FFmpeg's configure
--disable-decoder=h264,aac would; libavformat/demux.c otherwise calls into
the removed H.264 decoder. Companion to third_party-ffmpeg-BUILD.gn.patch.
Licence: modifies FFmpeg's generated configuration (LGPL-2.1-or-later); the
modified FFmpeg must be offered in source form under the LGPL (plan.md §3.7).
No upstream bug.
Repo: third_party/ffmpeg

